--[[
	ZystrixUI 2.3.0
	What changed vs 2.1.0
	  * One design system ("Library.Kit") for every floating surface: toast, dialog, dropdown, color picker, tooltip.
	    Same slab/face/glow/stroke/shadow, same 3D coin badge, same mono tag, same 3D keys, same tone palette.
	  * One tone palette (info / success / warning / error) used by Notify, Confirm, Log and Dashboard.
	  * Notify: Actions buttons, Progress (value or indeterminate), update-in-place by Id, duplicate merging (x2, x3),
	    6 screen positions, max-on-screen, quiet mode, history, handle:Update/SetProgress/Dismiss, OnClick, Persistent.
	  * Confirm: queue instead of dropping, Library:Alert / Library:Prompt, validated text input, countdown lock for
	    dangerous actions, "Don't ask again" (Remember), tone support, Enter/Esc hints.
	  * Tooltips: any element accepts Tooltip = "..." (and TooltipTitle); Library:AddTooltip(gui, text, title).
	  * Esc closes open dropdown / color picker. Delete Config now asks first.
	  * Settings tab: new Notifications section (position, max, quiet mode, tooltips, preview, clear, history).
]]
